{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-08-multi-agent-multi-person-design.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:06:18.537954Z","id":"7c8133a096ea19817ea9cdd96aae3218c3f43284e508b398720e04c587fe1c32","body":{"detail":"The owner's selection, verbatim: \"Yes\": a person may also remove a raise the install owner gave their agent. Confirms what DELETE /api/agents/<handle>/elevate?granter=owner already does for the agent's person (crates/clax-server/src/routes/people.rs unelevate_agent); stated in §7.2 and §7.4.","kind":"comment","span":{"start":{"line":1070},"end":{"line":1074},"content_hash":"bef8bff51138bef77c171b7bb8774b5a9d1326d1e10113528989035f0cd030d1"},"summary":"Decided (owner, 2026-10-14): \"Yes\", a person may remove a raise the install owner gave their agent","supersedes":"5d80366c333ba5fca1e8f2eec028edf60af6f8aa29a5083892d0b38e7b5f395b","tags":["status:decided","spec:7.4","owner-decision","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-08-multi-agent-multi-person-design.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:06:18.541066Z","id":"eaeb4d4b974e35a5c0fabe3ec2bd38d994c4308bcbf0048fdd9102fd854f4cb9","body":{"detail":"The owner's selection, verbatim: \"Yes\": a person may also remove a raise the install owner gave their agent. §7.4's DELETE ?granter=owner from the agent's person.","kind":"comment","span":{"start":{"line":1102},"end":{"line":1110},"content_hash":"d14bea70ad80c56928fef5dd863aab9ecce04638a0bba1a8719bcba0b1354ec5"},"summary":"Decided (owner, 2026-10-14): \"Yes\", the agent's person removes the owner's raise too","supersedes":"9717385be6fab407f9a3d9797095d1774b0037727d03ba554f5a29ca9710a032","tags":["status:decided","spec:7.4","owner-decision","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-08-multi-agent-multi-person-design.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:06:18.544092Z","id":"7f0c346c6b0fdaddee5c8771545758e56652d0ec313a842dfa9b501cd2f20631","body":{"detail":"The owner's answer to the question of record 9f714fe5 (web/shell/src/people/PersonCard.svelte) was \"Your content only\": on a person's card the install owner also sees that person's live approvals whose author is the owner (approvals covering the owner's content); a person's approvals of others' content stay private to them. Recorded in the spec as decision O12, here in §9.5, and in §17 and §18.","kind":"comment","span":{"start":{"line":1510},"end":{"line":1520},"content_hash":"316dfaafd68de7d72388900b58912ec1b24fc29db0f49a37bae9b0d00b10217c"},"summary":"Decided (owner, 2026-10-13): approvals in both directions on People, \"Your content only\"","supersedes":"5bd44fa171c711e40c2c629894884df5f1411ad3e03c0be9952ee71f53b33294","tags":["status:decided","spec:9.5","owner-decision","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-08-multi-agent-multi-person-design.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:30:59.641739Z","id":"8a9e2328eebc5314c7545b12b90986306b0246042982fdd7cc39e284b4a7b1b3","body":{"detail":"Seen on a scratch daemon: Sam's thread sent to the owner's agent, declined by the owner. Mia, not concerned, reads plain 'sent'; she adds '+1' and from then on reads 'declined by Alex', the owner's decision about Sam's content. Section 10 makes 'the thread's authors' concerned, and concerns() (crates/clax-server/src/feedback.rs:623-630) counts an author of any one comment. This follows the 2026-10-14 decision's wording, but it lets any connected person who can comment read whose approval any thread waits for, which the decision 'Only about their content' (approves-first) withholds. Options: keep it; or show a co-author only the held states of rows of their own comments.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":1469},"end":{"line":1472},"content_hash":"b64c9d19dcc55f6f6707998f7a614299db82d00b15631e783381c8606cef7c1b"},"summary":"Any connected person becomes concerned by adding a comment to a thread, and then reads its approver and declines of other authors","tags":["review","people","spec:10","status:needs-decision","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-08-multi-agent-multi-person-design.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-15T02:18:37.733998Z","id":"6aa3fd5cc69c50087dc11d6e7799777d90295ca2df2be3839cae8501f1f79c1c","body":{"detail":"The owner's selection, verbatim: \"Only the held content's author\". A person sees a hold or decline only about content they wrote: the author of the held or declined comment, or of the page if that is what is held. Commenting on a thread does not make a person concerned about others' content. The owner sees all; the approver sees their own decisions. Record ce3b4bcc is settled the same way: a page's author is concerned about holds of their page's content. Stated in section 10's table (the author row).","kind":"comment","references":"8a9e2328eebc5314c7545b12b90986306b0246042982fdd7cc39e284b4a7b1b3","summary":"Decided (owner, 2026-10-14): \"Only the held content's author\": commenting on a thread makes no one concerned about others' content","tags":["status:decided","spec:10","owner-decision","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-08-multi-agent-multi-person-design.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-15T02:34:34.444207Z","id":"c8bd429642df38c7b7f51effd1317132f4defc6675d7a82e208f506c14102d6c","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:628b724a","summary":"Fixed as decided ('Only the held content's author'): a person reads the rows of content they wrote and of their own agents (DeliveryViewer::Person). api_approvals::a_comment_on_anothers_held_thread_shows_nothing_of_its_hold passes: Mia's '+1' on Sam's thread shows her only her own comment's delivery, never the owner's hold or decline of Sam, in views, boot and events, also after the owner allows Sam and the take delivers his comment. Mutations M1 and M5 are caught by it.","supersedes":"8a9e2328eebc5314c7545b12b90986306b0246042982fdd7cc39e284b4a7b1b3","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-08-multi-agent-multi-person-design.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-15T02:34:34.456554Z","id":"57ba4d63cd8fdde6818d5b8abab5640633dd1985b98700493c03df59da00b382","body":{"kind":"comment","span":{"start":{"line":1773},"end":{"line":1775},"content_hash":"394476b88b9005376600f3695b3282f6d08bef1785b8eea913edb96f4e604a55"},"summary":"Decided by the owner (2026-10-14): threads show the withheld and declined states only as section 10 says who reads them (\"Declined by Mia\" for those concerned; plain \"sent\" for visitors).","supersedes":"1d96024914d43da73b831c839c53a76ee2ee86c1909963ffcbb048c1c7fb6358","tags":["status:decided","decision","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-08-multi-agent-multi-person-design.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-15T02:34:34.457832Z","id":"4eeb6343e4a9b9d587684c7e391276b7d67ef93a5606801b67ed28cddd3926fa","body":{"kind":"comment","span":{"start":{"line":1789},"end":{"line":1789},"content_hash":"513ea264f08780c7a365c6057a74dd6aa0d1046a46b8e12157b34f789dd7fddc"},"summary":"Decided by the owner (2026-10-14): \"No\" for the owner's agents (no approver, ever), plain \"sent\" for visitors (LAN viewers read plain delivery states), and connected people keep 'Only about their content' for whose approval a thread waits for.","supersedes":"502a40232e32c47fc8bf0a48d42d63f8aa1f3b61cf2a4600cdd0233d80de4115","tags":["status:decided","decision","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-08-multi-agent-multi-person-design.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-15T03:13:46.565984Z","id":"31304728ba8034aa0ae21c0c45b38faac0bf5a4117a19893e595a0ed0ac63273","body":{"detail":"The owner's selection on record 020a270d, verbatim: \"Accept it\". After an approval, apply_decision (crates/clax-server/src/feedback.rs) wakes the approver's agents; their take of the released rows marks them working (crates/clax-server/src/routes/feedback.rs, working::mark_items), and Event::Working reaches the gallery, working and agents topics of every subscriber. Anyone may so see an agent start work right after a decision they cannot read; it tells them neither that anything was held, nor whose approval, nor that a decision was made. Agent activity and replies stay visible; no code change. Stated in section 10 (Who reads which).","kind":"waiver","span":{"start":{"line":1639},"end":{"line":1647},"content_hash":"b33757b3c3d57581a18be43a3cd9b687b77da85979c30b20b164e3350700399f"},"summary":"Decided (owner, 2026-10-14): 'Accept it': an agent's working state after an approval stays visible like any agent's work","tags":["status:decided","spec:10","owner-decision","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
